    "Menu screen: header with order-type badge (take-out badge repeats '음료 1잔당 컵 200원') and 처음으로; 6 category tabs; 3-column item grid; cart panel at the bottom with quantity +/-, delete (X) with confirmation, 전체삭제, 주문 금액, 포장컵 비용 (take-out only), 합계, 주문하기",
    "Item option modal: groups in order (size, temperature, ice, sweetness, extra shot, toppings or flavor), quantity stepper, 취소 / 'N원 담기'; missing required choice shows a red error",
    "Set modal (drinks only, after 담기): step 1/3 drink only vs 스낵 세트로 변경 (-800원); step 2/3 choose snack; step 3/3 confirm set price -> 장바구니 담기",
    "Stamp popup (once per session, right after the first item lands in the cart): 적립 안 함 / X, or 휴대폰 번호로 적립 -> keypad -> 확인 -> 적립 예정 -> 확인",
